        "# Free threading\n",
        "\n",
        "Free threading allows multiple threads to execute Python code in parallel without a global interpreter lock. Shared state still requires appropriate synchronization.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-free-threading)"
      ]
    }
